# Alizen has NO required environment variables.
# All configuration is done in the browser by the user (BYOK).
#
# Optional: If you self-host and want to inject a default API key for
# your own instance (not recommended for public deployments — it would
# let visitors spend your credits), you can set:
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_OPENAI_KEY=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DEFAULT_PROVIDER=openrouter
